### 1. 员工入职 (正常流程)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/erp/employees/onboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "deptId": 101,
  "baseSalary": 15000.00
}

### 2. 员工入职 (正常流程 2)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/erp/employees/onboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "deptId": 102,
  "baseSalary": 12000.00
}

### 3. 员工入职 (事务回滚演示) - 名字叫 ERROR_TEST 会触发回滚
POST http://localhost:8083/api/erp/employees/onboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ERROR_TEST",
  "deptId": 103,
  "baseSalary": 20000.00
}

### 4. 查看员工列表 (验证 ERROR_TEST 是否没入库)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/erp/employees

### 5. 批量计算 2023-11 月薪资
POST http://localhost:8083/api/erp/salaries/calculate?month=2023-11

### 6. 查看部门薪资统计报表
GET http://localhost:8083/api/erp/reports/salary-by-dept
